	"data": "Fiction-to-Spec Mapping: Estia's World → Skill Trees\n\nThe fiction is the better design document. This mapping extracts engineering decisions from the narrative so the spec can catch up to what the story already knows.\n\nOpen Question 1: Custom Language/Vocabulary\n\nSpec asks: What vocabulary should the system use, avoiding direct RPG tropes?\n\nFiction answers:\nAttunement — the act of connecting to an energy type. Not \"learning a skill\" — attuning to a domain. The word implies relationship, not…",
